OL,3,ABurnham cancels engagements after death
OL,4,Aof father
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fcancelled engagements for Monday and
OL,8,FTuesday following the death of his
OL,9,Ffather Roy.
OL,11,FBurnham has previously spoken about his
OL,12,Ffather, who had Alzheimer's, when
OL,13,Fexplaining why he was so determined to
OL,14,Freform adult social care in England.
OL,16,FThe PM had been due to host a meeting
OL,17,Fof business leaders in Downing Street
OL,18,Flater.
OL,20,FHe revealed his father did not know he
OL,21,Fhad become prime minister in July,
OL,22,Fbecause of his condition.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
